      "title": "Chapter 10 U.S. Grain Exports: Corn, Wheat & Rice Buyers",
      "shortDescription": "How much corn, wheat, rice and sorghum the U.S. exports, who buys it, and what each top buyer charges, from 2020–2025 UN Comtrade data.",
